{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《女神配對計劃2》熱播當中，中阮嘉敏與吳旭東的浪漫故事感動了萬千網民，成為節目的一大亮點。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-25-14h36m35s800.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026h0SN4jF5fl1790320242.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-25-14h36m35s800.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">吳旭東在社交平台分享了兩人當年合作拍攝短劇時的幕後花絮短片，兩人跟着音樂節奏同步擺出手勢，配合默契十足，拍攝期間兩人相視而笑，互動氛圍溢滿甜甜的粉紅泡泡。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-25-14h36m39s200.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026iHG8vXDz1O1790320258.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-25-14h36m39s200.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">吳旭東感觸良多，在社交平台上載影片並留：「緣分就是這麼的奇妙吧…剪完這個片子將其反復觀看了很多遍，甜甜的感覺..現在想起來還是感覺好唔真實」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T02:18:32.290430+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}